[2026-09-21 15:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 160] STEP PURPOSE
[2026-09-21 15:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 160] --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[2026-09-21 15:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 160]   Step 160 -- Independent two-leg refit of the interstellar objects.
[2026-09-21 15:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 160]   Step 101 (iso_ng_channel) tests the ISOs through their fitted
[2026-09-21 15:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 160]   non-gravitational ledger against the cap-transit geometry; step 128
[2026-09-21 15:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 160]   built the leg-split machinery that resolves the post-2017 lapse-slip
[2026-09-21 15:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 160]   class on raw MPC astrometry.  This step crosses the two: each ISO's
[2026-09-21 15:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 160]   raw MPC observation set is split at perihelion, each leg is fitted
[2026-09-21 15:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 160]   independently by the step_127 LM differential-correction instrument
[2026-09-21 15:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 160]   (REBOUND/IAS15 + DE440s, one-way light time, topocentric parallax,
[2026-09-21 15:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 160]   MAD clip), and each fitted leg is propagated to the 250 AU
[2026-09-21 15:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 160]   barycentric sphere through the shared integrate_leg machinery.
[2026-09-21 15:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 160]   The product is a zero-catalogue boundary record per ISO: per-leg
[2026-09-21 15:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 160]   asymptote directions and their cap classifications, the inter-leg
[2026-09-21 15:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 160]   non-closure ddirf, the leg-vs-osculating deviations d_in_leg /
[2026-09-21 15:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 160]   d_out_leg, the cross-arc prediction loss, and the perihelion-epoch
[2026-09-21 15:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 160]   disagreement between legs (the step_159 timing channel).
[2026-09-21 15:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 160]   3I/ATLAS is the case of interest: its outbound asymptote sits inside
[2026-09-21 15:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 160]   the declared cap (46.9 deg from the axis, step 101), so its outbound
[2026-09-21 15:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 160]   leg realises a post-2017-style in-cap transit through the machinery
[2026-09-21 15:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 160]   that carries the registered anomaly class.  Its fitted NG parameters
[2026-09-21 15:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 160]   are retained as the volatile-confound context: a real outgassing
[2026-09-21 15:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 160]   acceleration inflates leg disagreement through solver absorption
[2026-09-21 15:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 160]   symmetrically, so the interpretation registers magnitude and
[2026-09-21 15:43:16 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 160]   localization jointly, not either alone.
